ize start and stop. The same applies to devices attached to the remote bus =
(e.g. 35900 or MSD).=20
Devices that are not synchronized might be either stopped too early which l=
eads to data loss, or too late which causes time-out errors. This affects E=
LSD detectors, SFC modules, modules with GCI drivers or 3rd party modules w=
ith RC.Net drivers, e.g Waters Alliance modules.</font></pre><p></p>
