s was not maximized users could move the foreground window aside and regain=
 access to the 'save as' dialog.=20

If the ChemStation window was maximized:=20
  - open the Windows task manager on the CDS client
  - Select the current instrument under the applications tab=20
  - Press the SWITCH TO button

This brings the SAVE as dialog back to the foreground.</font></pre><p></p>
<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">Fix Information:</font></b><=
br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">Fixed in OpenLAB CDS Chem=
Station C.01.06.</font></pre><p></p>




