<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">Problem:</font></b><br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">Only the Adobe Acrobat Re=
ader Classic track is supported by ChemStation and runs in a 'sandbox' prot=
