<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">One-line Description:</font>=
</b><br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">Single runs in self-assem=
bled data sets cannot be integrated</font></pre><p></p>
