<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">Problem:</font></b><br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">Incomplete Result Set pac=
kage (sc.ssizip) was sent to ECM. The incomplete ssizip package is caused b=
y a specific character in the method name (e.g. DLX-ENANTIOMERIC-33=E2=84=
=83.M). The degree symbol (=E2=84=83) in the method name causes the Dynazip=
 compression tool to fail and stop, resulting in an incomplete package uplo=
aded to OpenLAB ECM.=20

As long as the ChemStation is not closed, the local copy was available and =
was reprocessed to create additional versions.  Each of these versions also=
 was missing data since the compression failed again on the special charact=
er.  The option "Cleanup Data on Shutdown" was selected, so the local copy =
of the data was also deleted when shutting down the ChemStation.  In such a=
 case, the data was lost and can't be recovered.

The following error was observed:  DynaZip UnZIP Error: Error creating outp=
ut file.</font></pre><p></p>
