b><br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">Special character usage i=
n file names must be avoided.  Refer to the Concepts Manual.</font></pre><p=
></p>
<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">Fix Information:</font></b><=
br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">Fixed in OpenLAB CDS C.01=
.06.</font></pre><p></p>




