</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">Certain situations are po=
ssible where incomplete versions of result sets are uploaded to the backend=
 storage. This affects all ChemStation versions with ECM or Data Store.
 These situations are triggered by the way that online and offline versions=
 of the same instrument are aligned. A workflow is likely to provoke such a=
 situation, when the same result set is loaded in both sessions at the same=
 time.</font></pre><p></p>
