me of the event.

The result is that certain events are not executed during analysis.

Example
6.4 =E2=80=93 V2 ON
8.4 =E2=80=93 V1 ON
8.84 =E2=80=93 V1 OFF
13.05 =E2=80=93 V1 ON
14.7 =E2=80=93 V1 OFF
20 =E2=80=93 V2 ON

Becomes
13.05 =E2=80=93 V1 ON
14.7 =E2=80=93 V1 OFF
20 =E2=80=93 V2 ON
6.4 =E2=80=93 V2 ON
8.4 =E2=80=93 V1 ON
8.84 =E2=80=93 V1 OFF

In this case, the last three events (with a time less than then 20 minutes =
of event 3) are not executed.

This issue was introduced with GC drivers rev 3.1.
</font></pre><p></p>
<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">Temporary Solution:</font></=
