b><br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">To reconstruct the origin=
al sequence the batch file needs to be removed from the sequence folder. Cl=
ear the Navigation Table and load the individual runs from the file menu. T=
hen create a new result set from the runs using the functionality from the =
Sequence menu.</font></pre><p></p>
