orary solution as the manual edits are overwritten by further table edits.<=
/font></pre><p></p>
<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">Fix Information:</font></b><=
br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">A fix is planned for the =
next release of the Report Template Editor component of OpenLAB CDS.</font>=
</pre><p></p>




