ntification results of the calibration runs.</font></pre><p></p>
<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">Fix Information:</font></b><=
br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">Fixed in OpenLAB CDS C.01=
.06.=20
The fix only affects data acquired with Rev. C.01.06 or higher.</font></pre=
><p></p>




