 formatted values (e.g. 0.8 ul,  2.4 ul,...) may get propagated to all foll=
owing injections. If the injection specific injection volume is an integer =
value (1,2,3, ... ) this defect does not occur.=20

The applied injection volume appears on classical as well as on intelligent=
 reports.</font></pre><p></p>
<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">Temporary Solution:</font></=
b><br>
