the default injection volume to each sequence line (e.g. by using the seque=
nce fill down wizard) and modify the injection volume for those injections =
where a non-default values should be used.</font></pre><p></p>
<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">Fix Information:</font></b><=
br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">This defect is fixed LC/C=
