artial acquisition. The sample selection screen appears. Close this screen =
by using the x button in the upper right corner or by pressing the Esc key.
This does not properly clean up the process. The next sequence that will be=
 queued will end up in the existing result set that has been selected earli=
er.</font></pre><p></p>
<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">Temporary Solution:</font></=
b><br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">Use the Cancel button to =
