.. function in the Data Analysis view.
Systems with backend storage allow access to all data files and restoration=
 of the separate result sets can by done manually.
On systems with no versioning and identical file names the newer runs will =
overwrite the existing runs.</font></pre><p></p>
<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">Fix Information:</font></b><=
br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">Fixed in OpenLAB CDS C.01=
.06.</font></pre><p></p>




