</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">Entry of Numeric Sample P=
arameters is Not Allowed for Injections of Sample Type Calibration</font></=
pre><p></p>
<p><b><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"3">Problem:</font></b><br>
</p><pre><font face=3D"arial,sanserif" size=3D"2">For runs with the sample =
